@JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### 1. Success (204 No Content): Candidate 1 cancels their pending application (Status: Applied)
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
X-Candidate-Id: 1
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Success (204 No Content): Candidate 1 cancels their application under review (Status: UnderReview)
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/2
X-Candidate-Id: 1
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Forbidden (403 Forbidden): Candidate 2 attempts to cancel Candidate 1's application
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
X-Candidate-Id: 2
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Conflict (409 Conflict): Candidate 2 attempts to cancel application already at Interview stage
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/3
X-Candidate-Id: 2
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Conflict (409 Conflict): Repeated cancellation (Application 4 is already Cancelled)
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/4
X-Candidate-Id: 2
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Not Found (404 Not Found): Application ID does not exist
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/999
X-Candidate-Id: 1
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Unauthorized (401 Unauthorized): Request sent without candidate credentials or header
DELETE {{JobaApplication.Api_HostAddress}}/api/applications/1
Accept: application/json

###
